B.ak2=s(["Moved the ledger type explanation behind a question-mark button with display time adjusted to the message length.","Removed persistent helper text below linked advance expenses and schedule reminders to reduce form height.","Reduced mobile ledger dialog padding, field spacing, and note height so primary fields and the save action fit in the initial view."],t.s)
